"""
PC Storage Intelligence — Day 06/100
Windows 10 compatible, standard-library-only desktop utility.

Features:
- Background folder/drive scanning with progress and cancellation
- Storage summary, largest files, extension breakdown
- Duplicate detection using size + SHA-256 verification
- Search/filter scanned files
- Review-only cleanup candidates (no automatic deletion)
- Explicitly confirmed deletion of selected files
- CSV export
- Persistent scan results are not saved; all results remain in memory
"""

